(B) Lemma V (mean-value bound): any C^1 odd 2pi-periodic s with s(k)=k on |k|<=b has, along an axis,
    max |dE/dk| >= (sqrt(m^2+b^2) - m)/(pi - b)  (since s(pi)=0).  Threshold b*(m) where the bound = 1:
    m=0.00: b* = 1.57080   bound at b=2.0: 1.7519, at b=2.6: 4.8007
